<p>MFFU and Apex are nearly identical on cost and drawdown. The main differences are the 30% consistency rule at MFFU and the 100% vs 90% payout split. For bots with consistent daily performance, MFFU is a solid choice. For bots with more variable daily performance, Apex's lack of a consistency rule is an advantage.</p>

