<h2>Why Most Sites Still List MFFU as Banning Automation</h2>

<p>Prop firm comparison sites typically build their data once and update it infrequently. The July 2025 policy change at MFFU happened after many sites last reviewed their data. Since the change was made in firm documentation rather than announced as a major marketing push, it flew under the radar.</p>

